{"id":"c4e2705905167389","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-cup-product.md","title":"Cup Product","display":"df-cup-product — Cup Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cup-product","aliases":["58-df-cup-product","Cup Product"],"display":"df-cup-product — Cup Product","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cup-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cup-product</span><span>Cup Product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cup-product — Cup Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi,\\varphi,\\psi,\\Sigma,C_k,C_\\ell,R,\\cdot_R,\\operatorname{front},\\operatorname{back}\\in V\">\\(\\chi,\\varphi,\\psi,\\Sigma,C_k,C_\\ell,R,\\cdot_R,\\operatorname{front},\\operatorname{back}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (commutative-ring predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CupProductData}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{CupProductData}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span> (cup-product evaluation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cup\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CupProductData}_S(\\chi,\\varphi,\\psi,\\Sigma,C_k,C_\\ell,R,\\cdot_R,\\operatorname{front},\\operatorname{back})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\varphi,C_k,R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\psi,C_\\ell,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\operatorname{front},\\Sigma,C_k)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\operatorname{back},\\Sigma,C_\\ell)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\chi,\\Sigma,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma\\;\\chi(\\sigma)\n=\\varphi(\\operatorname{front}(\\sigma))\\cdot_R\\psi(\\operatorname{back}(\\sigma))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cup\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CupProductData}_S(\\chi,\\varphi,\\psi,\\Sigma,C_k,C_\\ell,R,\\cdot_R,\\operatorname{front},\\operatorname{back})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\varphi,C_k,R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\psi,C_\\ell,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\operatorname{front},\\Sigma,C_k)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\operatorname{back},\\Sigma,C_\\ell)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\chi,\\Sigma,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma\\;\\chi(\\sigma)\n=\\varphi(\\operatorname{front}(\\sigma))\\cdot_R\\psi(\\operatorname{back}(\\sigma))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The assertion gives the Alexander--Whitney evaluation relative to supplied cochain and front/back-face data.</li>\n<li>A canonical cup product on singular cochains additionally requires atoms constructing the singular cochain groups and the face maps; the generic cohomology atom does not supply those data.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Bott and Tu, Differential Forms in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (commutative-ring predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\chi,\\varphi,\\psi,\\Sigma,C_k,C_\\ell,R,\\cdot_R,\\operatorname{front},\\operatorname{back}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CupProductData}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cup\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CupProductData}_S(\\chi,\\varphi,\\psi,\\Sigma,C_k,C_\\ell,R,\\cdot_R,\\operatorname{front},\\operatorname{back})\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\varphi,C_k,R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\psi,C_\\ell,R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\operatorname{front},\\Sigma,C_k)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\operatorname{back},\\Sigma,C_\\ell)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\chi,\\Sigma,R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma\\;\\chi(\\sigma)\n=\\varphi(\\operatorname{front}(\\sigma))\\cdot_R\\psi(\\operatorname{back}(\\sigma))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1853,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-388","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-cup-product.md|58-df-cup-product]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6","36d7463d215be751"]}